type: dataset
title: "Dhammareader Tibetan Canon Edition"
abstract: >-
  A corrected Unicode edition of the ACIP Tibetan Kangyur (Lhasa edition),
  Tengyur (Derge edition) and Sungbum, with an apparatus that records every
  correction, its type, its evidence and its status, and catalogues of titles
  and persons.
